{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A continuing membership in practical psychotherapy</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Membership-based psychotherapy for steady progress and focused moments of change in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav">
        <a href="/about.html">Practitioner</a>
        <a href="/specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">Way of Working</a>
        <a href="/fees.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="/faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="/book.html" class="cta">Book a Visit</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Ongoing therapy in a membership format — thoughtful, steady, and practical</h1>
          <p class="lead">Structured weekly or monthly contact to help you track patterns, try small changes, and prepare for meaningful conversations.</p>

          <ul class="hero-actions">
            <li><a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
            <li><a class="secondary" href="/fees.html">See Membership Options</a></li>
          </ul>

          <p class="local">Serving adults in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Confidential teletherapy and limited in-person availability.</p>
        </div>

        <aside class="hero-panel">
          <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <defs>
              <pattern id="p" x="0" y="0" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <rect width="40" height="40" fill="#efe9e0"></rect>
                <path d="M0 20 Q10 0 20 20 T40 20" stroke="#cbb59a" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/>
                <circle cx="10" cy="30" r="3" fill="#b38b5a"/>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p)"></rect>
          </svg>

          <div class="panel-inner">
            <h3>Quick intake tools</h3>
            <p>Two short, private tools to help you prepare for an initial consultation or ongoing meetings.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><button class="open-widget" data-widget="planner">Open Session Planner</button></li>
              <li><button class="open-widget" data-widget="compass">Start Intake Compass</button></li>
              <li><button class="open-widget" data-widget="checklist">Start Focus Checklist</button></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="note">These tools are for reflection and to help shape conversations. They are not a diagnosis and don’t replace emergency services.</p>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="social-proof wrap">
      <h2>What clients say</h2>
      <div class="testimonials">
        <blockquote>
          "Reasoned guidance and useful follow-up tasks — I feel like progress is something I can keep track of."
          <cite>— A. in {{CITY}}</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          "A calm frame for messy weeks. The membership made scheduling predictable and less draining."
          <cite>— M., remote client</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="benefits wrap">
      <h2>How the membership helps</h2>
      <ul class="benefit-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Consistent touchpoints</strong>
          <p>Regular meetings to notice patterns and try small changes between sessions.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Flexible focus</strong>
          <p>Use appointments for ongoing work or for single matters that need concentrated attention.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Clear planning</strong>
          <p>Session plans and homework that connect to your immediate concerns and longer-term aims.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="process wrap">
      <h2>Simple process</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Intro conversation</strong> — Brief call to make sure our work would be a good fit.</li>
        <li><strong>Choose a membership level</strong> — Weekly, biweekly, or monthly contact with optional check-ins.</li>
        <li><strong>Regular sessions</strong> — Focused meetings with planning and takeaways.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="small">Confidentiality is central; we will review limits of confidentiality, coordination of care, and how to reach support in a crisis at your first appointment.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="tools wrap">
      <div class="tool-grid">
        <article class="tool" id="planner">
          <h3>Session Planner</h3>
          <p>Build a short, stepwise plan for upcoming sessions. Export a plaintext summary to bring to your appointment or to keep for yourself.</p>

          <form id="planner-form">
            <label>Primary aim for the next 4 sessions
              <input type="text" name="goal" placeholder="e.g., Manage overwhelm at work">
            </label>
            <label>Session rhythm
              <select name="rhythm">
                <option>Weekly</option>
                <option>Every two weeks</option>
                <option>Monthly</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>Three specific focuses (comma separated)
              <input type="text" name="focuses" placeholder="e.g., sleep, boundaries, self-criticism">
            </label>
            <label>Practical commitments between sessions
              <input type="text" name="between" placeholder="e.g., nightly log, breathing practice">
            </label>
            <button type="button" id="planner-generate">Generate Plan</button>
          </form>

          <h4>Your Plan</h4>
          <textarea id="planner-output" readonly rows="6"></textarea>
          <div class="tool-actions">
            <button id="planner-copy">Copy text</button>
            <button id="planner-download">Download .txt</button>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="tool" id="compass">
          <h3>Intake Compass</h3>
          <p>A gentle, guided set of prompts to notice concerns and formulate questions for a consultation.</p>

          <div id="compass-wizard" class="wizard">
            <div class="step" data-step="1">
              <p>What brought you to consider therapy now?</p>
              <textarea data-key="presenting" placeholder="Brief description"></textarea>
              <div class="wizard-controls"><button data-action="next">Next</button></div>
            </div>

            <div class="step" data-step="2" hidden>
              <p>How long have these concerns been present?</p>
              <select data-key="duration">
                <option>Less than 3 months</option>
                <option>3–12 months</option>
                <option>More than a year</option>
              </select>
              <div class="wizard-controls"><button data-action="back">Back</button> <button data-action="next">Next</button></div>
            </div>

            <div class="step" data-step="3" hidden>
              <p>What situations make things better or worse?</p>
              <textarea data-key="triggers" placeholder="Situations, people, times of day"></textarea>
              <div class="wizard-controls"><button data-action="back">Back</button> <button data-action="next">Next</button></div>
            </div>

            <div class="step" data-step="4" hidden>
              <p>What are the most important questions you would like to bring to a therapist?</p>
              <textarea data-key="questions" placeholder="Questions you want answered"></textarea>
              <div class="wizard-controls"><button data-action="back">Back</button> <button data-action="finish">Finish</button></div>
            </div>

            <div class="step result" data-step="5" hidden>
              <h4>Your Compass Summary</h4>
              <textarea id="compass-output" readonly rows="8"></textarea>
              <div class="tool-actions"><button id="compass-copy">Copy</button> <button id="compass-download">Download .txt</button></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="tool" id="checklist">
          <h3>Focus Checklist</h3>
          <p>A brief symptom and safety check to help you decide what to bring up in session. This is reflective — not diagnostic.</p>

          <form id="checklist-form">
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="items" value="Trouble sleeping"> Trouble sleeping</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="items" value="Low mood or joy"> Low mood or joy</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="items" value="Ongoing worry"> Ongoing worry</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="items" value="Changes in appetite or weight"> Changes in appetite or weight</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="items" value="Difficulty concentrating"> Difficulty concentrating</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="items" value="Thoughts of hurting self"> Thoughts of hurting self</label>
            <button type="button" id="checklist-generate">Make my checklist</button>
          </form>

          <h4>Checklist for my appointment</h4>
          <textarea id="checklist-output" readonly rows="6"></textarea>
          <div class="tool-actions"><button id="checklist-copy">Copy</button></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq wrap">
      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>What is a membership?</summary>
        <p>A membership sets a regular rhythm for sessions and a small set of included touches such as brief check-ins and scheduling. It is designed to help with steady work rather than only one-off support.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Will you share my records?</summary>
        <p>Confidentiality is respected. Records are only shared with your permission except where required by law (e.g., risk of harm). We review confidentiality and limits at intake.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What if I am in crisis?</summary>
        <p>If you are in immediate danger, please call your local emergency number or go to the nearest emergency room. If you are in {{STATE}} and need urgent help, contact local crisis resources. This practice does not provide emergency services.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="cta wrap">
      <h2>Ready to begin?</h2>
      <p>If you’d like to explore membership options, schedule a brief introductory call to determine fit and availability.</p>
      <p><a class="primary large" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></p>
      <p class="contact">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> — Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All sessions are confidential within legal limits. The therapist provides scope boundaries, including referrals when appropriate.</p>
      <p class="small">This site provides general information and tools for reflection. It is not a substitute for emergency care or a formal diagnosis.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
